# The arpeggiator: hold a chord on T1, ARP UP plays it a note at a time on the clock; letting go stops
# it; LATCH keeps it until a new chord comes; OFF lets it go. A kit has no arp.
wait 300
tap ARP
wait 150
expect page ARP
turn K1 1
wait 100
expect tp 1 ARP 1
key 12 down
key 16 down
key 19 down
wait 120
expect arpn 1 3
wait 1100
expect arphits_min 1 6
expect peak_db_min -40
shot arp.png
key 12 up
key 16 up
key 19 up
wait 200
expect arpn 1 0
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect page ARP 2
turn K1 1
wait 100
expect tp 1 LATCH 1
key 12 down
key 19 down
wait 100
key 12 up
key 19 up
wait 600
expect arpn 1 2
key 14 down
wait 60
key 14 up
wait 300
expect arpn 1 1
turn SELECT -1
wait 100
turn K1 -8
wait 120
expect tp 1 ARP 0
expect arpn 1 0
